The final allowed escalation is now under test. Its plaintext is only a short sentence, matching the paper’s empirically hardest length regime; the certificate and 26! candidate language are unchanged. If any vendor solves this rung, the rules require rejecting the family rather than tuning it further.
diff --git a/gen_2509_07282.py b/gen_2509_07282.py
